{"schema":1,"revision":80264510,"page":{"pageid":681342,"title":"黑髮","displayTitle":"黑髮","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chinese_American_girl.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Chinese_American_girl.jpg/250px-Chinese_American_girl.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"220\" height=\"275\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Chinese_American_girl.jpg/500px-Chinese_American_girl.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1368\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a><figcaption>一個黑髮的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"美國\">美國</a>華裔女孩。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Maria_Yamamoto_Fanime_2005_Meet_the_Guests_reception.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Maria_Yamamoto_Fanime_2005_Meet_the_Guests_reception.jpg/250px-Maria_Yamamoto_Fanime_2005_Meet_the_Guests_reception.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"220\" height=\"165\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Maria_Yamamoto_Fanime_2005_Meet_the_Guests_reception.jpg/500px-Maria_Yamamoto_Fanime_2005_Meet_the_Guests_reception.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1200\" /></a><figcaption>一個黑髮的<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"日本\">日本</a>女孩 （女<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%85%8D%E9%9F%B3%E5%91%98\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"配音員\">配音員</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E6%9C%AC%E9%BA%BB%E9%87%8C%E5%AE%89\" title=\"山本麻里安\">山本麻里安</a>）。</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>黑髮</b>是人類族群中最常見也是最深的髮色，範圍包括全黑到深褐色。所有種族都可見黑髮的存在，而多數屬於非歐洲血緣的人。黑髮的成因在於高量的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9C%9F%E9%BB%91%E8%89%B2%E7%B4%A0\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"真黑色素\">真黑色素</a>。在所有髮色中，黑髮是最有光澤的一種<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。\n</p><p>由於除了淺色毛髮的起源地歐洲以外，其他地區都是以黑髮為主，因此黑髮可能是人類的原始髮色，其中在下撒哈拉地區、亞洲以及哥倫布時代以前的美洲最為多見。在<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E5%8A%A0%E7%B4%A2%E4%BA%BA%E7%A8%AE\" title=\"高加索人種\">高加索人種</a>（<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E7%A7%8D%E4%BA%BA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"白種人\">白種人</a>）中，黑髮主要分佈在南歐、西亞、北非以及南亞，在北歐國家則相當少見。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參見\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.A6.8B\"></span>參見</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%BB%91%E9%AB%AE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參見\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%BA%E9%A1%9E%E8%86%9A%E8%89%B2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"人類膚色\">人類膚色</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%93%E9%AB%AE\" title=\"染髮\">染髮</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE\" title=\"金髮\">金髮</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%99%BD%E9%AB%AE%EF%BC%88%E9%AB%AE%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"白髮（髮色）（頁面不存在）\">白髮（髮色）</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考文獻\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8D.BB\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%BB%91%E9%AB%AE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Frost, Peter. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cogweb.ucla.edu/ep/Frost_06.html\">\"Why Do Europeans Have So Many Hair and Eye Colors?\"</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20171028214121/http://cogweb.ucla.edu/ep/Frost_06.html\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>） (summarizing Frost, P. 2006. European hair and eye color - A case of frequency-dependent sexual selection? Evolution and Human Behavior 27:85-103)</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%BB%91%E9%AB%AE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：外部連結\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173149\">.mw-parser-output .side-box{margin:4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px s